    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a [mandatory release gate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for all Meridian deployments, requiring a signed manifest before shipping. This decision, [formally recorded](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) on August 8, 2026, is framed as a corrective measure following [past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) where unsigned artifacts reached staging. The scope of this requirement [extends to both staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4), with Fairweather [assuming direct ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) of the implementation. The discourse is characterized by a shift from reactive, negative affect regarding past failures to a calm, authoritative stance on the new procedural standard.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
